# Repo lightweight lock (FROZEN 2026-09-12)

Keep the repo lean. **Deletion over addition** for artifacts.

## Never commit

| Category | Paths / patterns |
| --- | --- |
| Build cache | `.next/`, `out/`, `node_modules/` |
| Perf duplicate | `.perf/` (full app snapshot + Lighthouse JSON) |
| Audit screenshots | `shots/`, `app/scripts/shots-mobile/` |
| Logo scratch | `logo-refs/`, `logo/concepts/` |
| Research scrapes | `research/*.{html,png,log,mjs,txt}` — keep only `research/competitor-locations/*.json` and `research/renders-manifest-*.json` |
| Tool caches | `.playwright-mcp/`, `supabase/.temp/`, `.vercel/`, `__pycache__/` |
| Root scratch PNGs | `Screenshot *.png`, `v-*.png`, `*.docx` |
| Oversize new files | \>512 KB unless under `app/src/data/`, `logo/`, `app/public/`, or mobile `res/` assets |
| Git tree | **>96 MiB** or **>3500** tracked files (pre-commit + pre-push + prebuild) |
| Vercel output | **>100 MiB** `.next/server`+`static` after map strip (`postbuild --build`) |

## Agent rules

- Do not recreate `.perf/`, duplicate app trees, or commit visual audit PNGs.
- Competitor HTML/screenshots belong outside git or in local-only paths (already gitignored).
- Prefer updating existing JSON manifests over adding new research dumps.
- Run `node scripts/check-repo-weight.mjs --verbose` before large commits.
- After local audits: delete `shots/` — do not `git add` them.

## Hook (once per clone)

```bash
./scripts/setup-hooks.sh
```

- **pre-commit** — banned paths, oversize new files, **96 MiB / 3500-file tree cap**
- **pre-push** — full tracked-tree scan (catches `--no-verify` commits)
- **CI / Vercel** — `prebuild` `--ci` then `postbuild --build` (100 MiB deploy cap; strips `*.map`)
- **install** — `prepare` runs `./scripts/setup-hooks.sh` automatically

## Stay fast

- No duplicate app trees, scrape dumps, or audit PNGs in git (clone + CI stay fast).
- New deps need a one-line why; prefer stdlib / existing packages.
- Build caches (`.next/`, `*.sst`) stay gitignored — never commit them.
